// A hard link at the plate path is not the plate.
// The read ignores that file and does not open it.
// The other name keeps its bytes.
// The write replaces the plate path and leaves the other name.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hardlink ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law      ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hardlink law

IMPULSE hardlink 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hardlink" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
